        detailed: `Priessnitz §5.2: at present biologics provide symptom control rather than remission, with no evidence that they alter the natural history of AERD; longitudinal studies and registries are needed. Future directions include head-to-head trials of IL-4/IL-13 blockade against IL-5 or TSLP agents and newer agents (depemokimab, verekitug, lunsekimig, lebrikizumab, itepekimab, etokimab, stapokibart) (§5.4).\n\nApplication: counsel patients that stopping usually means recurrence, and that cost and access (often off-label for AERD) are part of the decision (§5.3).`,
        concepts: ['evidence-quality', 'real-world'],
